### Client Credentials Flow: step 1: Authenticate with Client ID + Client Secret. Credentials in BASIC. Client -> Auth.

POST http://localhost:8089/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic bTJtLWNsaWVudDptMm0tc2VjcmV0
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = client_credentials

### Client Credentials Flow: step 1: Authenticate with Client ID + Client Secret. Credentials in BASIC. Wrong Credentials. Client -> Auth.

POST http://localhost:8089/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic bTJtLWNsaWVudDptMm0td3Jvbmctc2VjcmV0
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = client_credentials

### Client Credentials Flow: step 1: Authenticate with Client ID + Client Secret. Credentials in POST. Client -> Auth.

POST http://localhost:8089/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = client_credentials &
client_id = m2m-client &
client_secret = m2m-secret

### Client Credentials Flow: step 1: Authenticate with Client ID + Client Secret. Credentials in POST. Wrong Credentials. Client -> Auth.

POST http://localhost:8089/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = client_credentials &
client_id = m2m-client &
client_secret = m2m-wrong-secret
